  "system": {
    "identifier": "fire-release-burning-gaze",
    "description": "<p>You direct your gaze at an object or creature within range. Your eyes begin to glow a violent bright red and the target erupts into flames for the duration. An object begins to burn as flames engulf it. A creature must make a Dexterity saving throw gaining the Burned condition. While you are concentrating on this jutsu, creatures currently suffering from the Burned condition that you can see, cannot extinguish the fires that are burning them.</p>",
